; A bad --now value is reported like any other bad option value, naming
; the option it came from, even though --now is applied before the
; other options.

2024/01/15 Payee A
    Expenses:Food    $50.00
    Assets:Checking

test reg --now garbage -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing option '--now'
Error: Unexpected date period token 'garbage'
end test

test reg --now -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing option '--now'
Error: No argument provided for --now
end test
